Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, ca-certificates, git
Section: ai
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://dev.meta.ai/
Description: Meta's terminal coding agent powered by Muse Spark
 Muse Code plans, edits, and runs commands to complete coding tasks,
 with approvals, an OS sandbox, multi-agent worktrees, session
 messaging, and MCP support. This package installs the official
 statically linked Linux binary and provides the muse command.
